      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wading_River%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Long Island Rail Road’s Port Jefferson Branch ran through Wading River from 1895 until the line closed in 1938.",
